# By default nothing under storage/app/public is tracked. This keeps
# database dumps portable (image_url columns store only relative paths).
# However a DB import does NOT move the binary files, so images that are
# part of the site content (products, categories, banners, news, logos,
# certification files, etc.) are tracked in git so a fresh deployment
# (git pull + php artisan storage:link) restores them.
#
# Admin/user-generated uploads (quotations, quotation line images) remain
# ignored - those are re-uploaded through the admin panel, not deployed.

*
!.gitignore

!products/
!products/**
!categories/
!categories/**
!banners/
!banners/**
!banner_images/
!banner_images/**
!news/
!news/**
!site/
!site/**
!certifications/
!certifications/**
!pages/
!pages/**
!brands/
!brands/**
!contact/
!contact/**
!social/
!social/**
!admin_profiles/
!admin_profiles/**
